        "question_6TM8ek": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who We Are",
            "answer": "<p>LOVE MY HUMAN is a trading name of The Love My Human Group Limited, a company registered in England and Wales. Our registered office is located at 308 King’s Road, London, SW3 5UH, United Kingdom.</p><p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we take your privacy seriously and are committed to protecting your personal information. We understand the importance of maintaining your trust and ensuring that any personal information you share with us is handled responsibly, securely and in accordance with applicable data protection legislation, including the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018.</p><p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, manage and protect your personal information when you visit our website, browse our products, create an account, place an order, subscribe to our communications or otherwise interact with LOVE MY HUMAN.</p><p>Throughout this Privacy Policy, references to \"LOVE MY HUMAN\", \"we\", \"us\" and \"our\" refer to The Love My Human Group Limited. References to \"you\" and \"your\" refer to any individual visiting our website, purchasing our products or interacting with our services.</p><p>We are responsible for deciding how and why your personal information is processed and are committed to ensuring that it is handled fairly, lawfully and transparently. We will only collect and use personal information where we have a legitimate reason and an appropriate legal basis to do so.</p><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, how we handle your personal information or wish to exercise any of your data protection rights, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a>.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_EwkQmN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What Personal Information We Collect",
            "answer": "<p>When you visit the LOVE MY HUMAN website, create an account, place an order or interact with us, we may collect certain personal information to enable us to provide you with the best possible shopping experience and deliver our services effectively.</p><p>The information we collect may include your name, billing address, delivery address, email address, telephone number and other contact details. When you place an order with us, we also collect information relating to your purchase, including the products ordered, order history, delivery preferences and transaction details.</p><p>If you create an account with LOVE MY HUMAN, we may collect your account login details and information associated with your account, including your saved addresses, preferences and previous purchases.</p><p>We may also automatically collect certain technical information when you browse our website. This may include your IP address, browser type, device information, operating system, general location data, pages visited, products viewed and how you interact with our website. This information helps us understand how customers use our website and allows us to improve its performance, functionality and overall shopping experience.</p><p>Where you contact our customer care team, we may retain the information you provide, including your name, contact details, order references and the contents of your correspondence, so that we can respond to your enquiries and provide appropriate assistance.</p><p>We only collect personal information that is relevant and necessary for the purposes explained in this Privacy Policy. We do not knowingly collect more information than is reasonably required to operate our business, fulfil your orders, provide customer support and maintain our relationship with you.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_Km6Kte": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How We Use Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we use your personal information to provide you with a seamless, secure and personalised shopping experience. We are committed to using your information responsibly and only for purposes that are relevant to our business and our relationship with you.</p><p>When you place an order through our website, we use your personal information to process and fulfil your purchase, arrange payment, organise delivery and provide you with updates regarding your order. This includes contacting you if there are any issues with your purchase, delivery or payment, or if we need to provide important information relating to the products or services you have requested.</p><p>We may also use your information to manage your customer account, respond to enquiries, provide customer care and assist with returns, refunds or exchanges. Where necessary, we may use your details to verify your identity, prevent fraudulent transactions, protect our business and ensure the security of our website and customers.</p><p>We use information about how visitors interact with our website to better understand customer preferences, improve our website's functionality and performance, develop our products and services, and make the overall shopping experience more relevant and enjoyable.</p><p>Where you have chosen to receive marketing communications from us, we may use your contact details to send you information about new collections, products, promotions, special offers and other LOVE MY HUMAN news that we believe may be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time.</p><p>We may also use your personal information where necessary to comply with our legal and regulatory obligations, enforce our terms and conditions, resolve disputes and protect the rights, property and interests of LOVE MY HUMAN and our customers.</p><p>We will not use your personal information for purposes that are incompatible with those explained in this Privacy Policy without first providing you with appropriate information and, where required by law, obtaining your consent.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_fUkhTL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How We Collect Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we collect personal information in a number of ways, primarily when you interact with our website, make a purchase or communicate with us. We aim to be transparent about how information is obtained and ensure that it is collected fairly and lawfully.</p><p>Most of the personal information we hold is provided directly by you. This may happen when you create an account, place an order, complete a purchase, sign up to receive our newsletter or marketing communications, enter a promotion, contact our customer care team or otherwise provide information through our website.</p><p>We may also collect information automatically when you browse or interact with our website. This can include technical information about your device, browsing activity, IP address, website usage and preferences. We may use cookies and similar technologies to understand how visitors use our website, remember certain preferences and improve the overall online shopping experience. Further information about these technologies can be found in our Cookies section of this Privacy Policy.</p><p>In certain circumstances, we may receive information about you from trusted third parties who support our business operations. These may include payment providers, delivery and logistics companies, website hosting providers, analytics services and marketing platforms, where they are involved in providing services to us or supporting your interaction with LOVE MY HUMAN.</p><p>We may also receive information from publicly available sources where this is necessary and appropriate for legitimate business purposes, such as preventing fraud or verifying information.</p><p>Regardless of how your personal information is collected, we take appropriate steps to ensure that it is handled securely, used only for legitimate purposes and processed in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_VTW3bp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Payment Information & Security",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we understand the importance of keeping your personal and financial information safe when shopping online. We take the security of your information seriously and work with established third-party payment providers to ensure that transactions made through our website are processed securely.</p><p>When you make a purchase, your payment information is collected and processed by our chosen payment service providers. We accept various payment methods, which may include credit and debit cards and other electronic payment services displayed at checkout. These providers are responsible for securely processing your payment in accordance with their own privacy and security policies.</p><p>We do not intend to store or retain full payment card details, including your complete card number or security code, on our own systems. Where payment providers offer a secure card-saving facility for future purchases, any stored payment credentials are managed in accordance with the provider's security arrangements.</p><p>We may receive limited payment-related information, such as transaction references, payment status and confirmation details, which we use to manage orders, process refunds, respond to payment enquiries and maintain accurate business records.</p><p>Our website uses appropriate security measures designed to protect the personal information submitted through our online services. However, no method of transmitting or storing information electronically can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p><p>We encourage customers to take appropriate precautions when shopping online, including keeping account passwords confidential and notifying us immediately if they suspect any unauthorised access to their LOVE MY HUMAN account.</p><p>For further information about how your payment information is handled, we recommend reviewing the privacy policies of the relevant payment providers.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_wKbTHq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Cookies & Website Tracking",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we use cookies and similar technologies to help ensure that our website functions effectively and to provide you with a smooth, convenient and personalised shopping experience.</p><p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer, mobile phone or other device when you visit a website. They allow the website to recognise your device, remember certain information about your visit and help improve how the website operates.</p><p>We may use different types of cookies for a variety of purposes. Essential cookies are necessary for our website to function properly and enable features such as navigating the website, adding products to your shopping basket, completing purchases and accessing your account. Other cookies may help us remember your preferences, understand how visitors use our website and improve its performance.</p><p>We may also use analytical and performance cookies to collect information about how visitors interact with our website, including which pages are visited most frequently, which products attract the most interest and whether visitors experience any technical difficulties. This information helps us better understand our customers and continually improve our website and services.</p><p>Where applicable, we may use advertising and marketing cookies or similar tracking technologies to help us deliver more relevant advertising, measure the effectiveness of marketing campaigns and understand how customers interact with our advertisements across different platforms.</p><p>Some cookies may be placed by third-party services that appear on or support our website. These third parties may collect information about your browsing activity in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p><p>You can manage your cookie preferences through our website's cookie consent settings, where available. You can also adjust your browser settings to block or delete cookies. Please be aware that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of our website and some features may not operate as intended.</p><p>Where required by law, we will ask for your consent before placing non-essential cookies or using similar tracking technologies on your device. You can change or withdraw your consent at any time through the available cookie settings.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_9gHBti": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Marketing & Email Communications",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we love keeping our customers informed about our latest collections, new arrivals, exclusive offers and everything happening across our brand. From time to time, we may send you marketing communications and updates that we believe may be of interest to you.</p><p>If you choose to subscribe to our newsletter or opt in to receive marketing communications, we may use your name and email address to send you information about new products, seasonal collections, special promotions, events, exclusive offers and other LOVE MY HUMAN news.</p><p>We may also use information about your previous purchases, browsing activity and preferences to make our communications more relevant to your interests and shopping habits, where permitted by applicable data protection laws.</p><p>We will only send you direct marketing communications where we have an appropriate legal basis to do so. You are always in control of your marketing preferences and can choose to stop receiving promotional emails at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link included at the bottom of our marketing emails.</p><p>Please note that even if you unsubscribe from marketing communications, we may still need to contact you with important non-promotional messages relating to your orders, purchases, account, deliveries, returns, refunds or other customer service matters.</p><p>We will never require you to receive marketing communications as a condition of making a purchase from LOVE MY HUMAN. Your decision to subscribe or unsubscribe will not affect your ability to shop with us or use our website.</p><p>We respect your preferences and are committed to ensuring that any marketing communications we send are relevant, appropriate and handled in accordance with applicable privacy and electronic marketing regulations.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_wPqNHC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Sharing Your Personal Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we respect your privacy and understand the importance of keeping your personal information confidential. We do not sell your personal information to third parties. However, in order to operate our business, fulfil your orders and provide you with our services, it may be necessary to share certain information with carefully selected third-party companies and service providers.</p><p>These may include payment processing providers who securely handle transactions, delivery and logistics partners who require your name and delivery address to fulfil orders, and website hosting and technology providers who help us operate and maintain our website.</p><p>We may also share relevant information with customer service platforms, email and marketing service providers, website analytics providers and other business partners who assist us in managing our day-to-day operations and improving the services we offer. These organisations are only permitted to use your information where necessary to provide services to us or for other lawful purposes.</p><p>In certain circumstances, we may also disclose personal information where required to do so by law, regulation, court order or a request from an authorised regulatory or law enforcement authority. We may also share information where reasonably necessary to protect our legal rights, prevent fraud, investigate suspected unlawful activity or safeguard the security of our business and customers.</p><p>Where we use third-party service providers, we take reasonable steps to ensure that appropriate contractual, technical and organisational safeguards are in place to protect your personal information and that it is handled in accordance with applicable data protection legislation.</p><p>We aim to ensure that any sharing of personal information is limited to what is necessary for the relevant purpose and that your privacy is respected at every stage.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_yGx4K7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Third-Party Websites & Services",
            "answer": "<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, platforms and services that are not owned, operated or controlled by LOVE MY HUMAN. These links may include social media platforms, designer and brand websites, payment providers, delivery services and other external websites that we believe may be of interest or relevant to our customers.</p><p>Please be aware that when you leave the LOVE MY HUMAN website and visit an external website, you are subject to that website's own terms, privacy policy and data protection practices. We have no control over how third-party websites collect, use, store or process your personal information and cannot accept responsibility for their privacy practices or the content of their websites.</p><p>We recommend that you take the time to read the relevant privacy policies and terms and conditions of any third-party websites or services you choose to use, particularly before providing them with personal or payment information.</p><p>Where we work with third-party service providers to support our website and business operations, we take reasonable steps to ensure that they handle any personal information shared with them appropriately and in accordance with applicable data protection requirements.</p><p>The inclusion of any external link on our website does not necessarily constitute an endorsement of that website, its products, services or privacy practices.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_MkQ7Ed": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How Long We Keep Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we only retain your personal information for as long as is reasonably necessary to fulfil the purposes for which it was collected, including providing our products and services, managing your customer account, fulfilling orders and meeting our legal, accounting and regulatory obligations.</p><p>The length of time we retain your information will depend on the type of information involved and the reason it was collected. For example, we may need to keep records of purchases, payments, refunds and other transactions for an appropriate period to comply with our legal and financial reporting obligations.</p><p>Where you have created an account with us, we may retain your account information for as long as your account remains active or as otherwise necessary to provide our services. If you choose to close your account, we will take appropriate steps to delete or anonymise your personal information, unless we are legally required or otherwise permitted to retain it.</p><p>Information relating to customer enquiries, complaints, returns and other correspondence may also be retained for an appropriate period so that we can manage our customer relationships, resolve any outstanding matters and maintain accurate business records.</p><p>Where we no longer have a legitimate business or legal reason to retain your personal information, we will take reasonable steps to securely delete it or anonymise it so that it can no longer be used to identify you.</p><p>We regularly review the personal information we hold to ensure that it is not kept for longer than necessary and that it continues to be handled in accordance with applicable data protection legislation.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_ENA3w7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Your Privacy Rights (GDPR)",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we respect your rights when it comes to your personal information and are committed to ensuring that you remain in control of how your data is collected, used and stored. Under applicable data protection legislation, including the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and the Data Protection Act 2018, you have a number of rights in relation to the personal information we hold about you.</p><p>You have the right to request access to the personal information we hold about you and to receive a copy of that information. You may also ask us to correct any information that is inaccurate, incomplete or out of date, helping us ensure that the details we hold remain accurate and up to date.</p><p>In certain circumstances, you have the right to request the deletion of your personal information, restrict how we use it or object to particular types of processing. You may also have the right to request that your personal information is provided to you in a commonly used, machine-readable format or transferred to another organisation, where the legal requirements for data portability are met.</p><p>Where we rely on your consent to process personal information, you have the right to withdraw that consent at any time. Withdrawing your consent will not affect the lawfulness of any processing carried out before your consent was withdrawn.</p><p>You also have the right to object to receiving direct marketing communications from us at any time. You can exercise this right by using the unsubscribe link included in our marketing emails or by contacting us directly.</p><p>To exercise any of your privacy rights, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a>. We may need to verify your identity before responding to your request to ensure that your personal information is protected. We aim to respond within one month of receiving a valid request, although this period may be extended in certain circumstances permitted by law.</p><p>You also have the right to raise a concern or make a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO), the UK's independent data protection regulator, if you believe your personal information has not been handled appropriately. Further information can be found at <a href=\"http://www.ico.org.uk\">www.ico.org.uk</a>.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_RUr7LJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How We Protect Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, protecting your personal information is extremely important to us. We are committed to maintaining the privacy, security and confidentiality of the information entrusted to us and take appropriate measures to help prevent it from being lost, misused, accessed without authorisation, altered or disclosed improperly.</p><p>We use appropriate technical and organisational security measures designed to safeguard the personal information we collect and hold. These measures are intended to protect your information against unauthorised access, accidental loss, destruction or damage, and are reviewed periodically to ensure they remain appropriate for our business and the way we operate.</p><p>Access to personal information is restricted to those employees, representatives and authorised third-party service providers who need it for legitimate business purposes. We expect anyone handling personal information on our behalf to respect its confidentiality and take appropriate steps to keep it secure.</p><p>We also work with established third-party providers to support areas of our business such as payment processing, website hosting and order fulfilment. Where these providers handle personal information on our behalf, we take reasonable steps to ensure that suitable safeguards and contractual protections are in place.</p><p>Although we take reasonable precautions to protect your information, no website, electronic transmission or method of data storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure. We therefore cannot guarantee absolute security, but we remain committed to maintaining appropriate safeguards and responding responsibly to any suspected security incidents.</p><p>If you believe your personal information or LOVE MY HUMAN account may have been compromised, we encourage you to contact us immediately at <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a> so that we can investigate and take appropriate action.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_mtAWgq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Children's Privacy",
            "answer": "<p>At LOVE MY HUMAN, we take the privacy and protection of children's personal information seriously. Our website, products and services are primarily intended for adults, and we do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children without appropriate parental or guardian involvement where required by law.</p><p>If you are under the age of 18, we encourage you to seek permission from a parent or legal guardian before providing any personal information through our website, creating an account or making a purchase.</p><p>We do not knowingly use our website to collect personal information from children for marketing purposes or encourage children to share personal details with us. Where we become aware that we have inadvertently collected personal information from a child in circumstances where we should not have done so, we will take appropriate steps to review the information and delete it where legally required.</p><p>If you are a parent or legal guardian and believe that your child has provided personal information to LOVE MY HUMAN without appropriate consent, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a> so that we can look into the matter and take any necessary action.</p><p>We remain committed to handling all personal information responsibly and ensuring that our website is used in an appropriate and safe manner.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_7mMz4B": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "International Data Transfers",
            "answer": "<p>LOVE MY HUMAN operates from the United Kingdom; however, some of the third-party service providers and business partners we work with may operate in other countries. As a result, your personal information may, in certain circumstances, be transferred to, stored or processed outside the United Kingdom.</p><p>Where your personal information is transferred internationally, we take appropriate steps to ensure that it continues to receive a level of protection consistent with applicable UK data protection legislation.</p><p>Depending on the circumstances, this may include transferring information to countries that have been recognised as providing an adequate level of data protection, or putting appropriate safeguards in place, such as approved international data transfer agreements or other legally recognised mechanisms.</p><p>We take reasonable steps to ensure that any third parties handling personal information on our behalf maintain appropriate security measures and respect the confidentiality of your information.</p><p>By using our website and services, you acknowledge that your personal information may be processed by service providers operating in different countries, subject to the protections and requirements set out in this Privacy Policy and applicable data protection laws.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_JxQgJ3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Our Legal Basis for Processing Your Information",
            "answer": "<p>LOVE MY HUMAN will only use your personal information where we have a lawful basis to do so under applicable data protection laws. The legal basis we rely on will depend on the type of information involved and the purpose for which it is being used.</p><p>In certain circumstances, we process your personal information because it is necessary to perform a contract with you, such as when processing an order, arranging delivery, managing your account or providing customer support. We may also process information where we are required to do so to comply with a legal obligation, including applicable tax, accounting and regulatory requirements.</p><p>We may rely on our legitimate interests, or those of a relevant third party, where processing is necessary for purposes such as operating and improving our website, managing our business, preventing fraud, maintaining website security and responding to enquiries. We will only rely on this basis where those interests are not overridden by your rights and freedoms. Where we rely on legitimate interests, you may have the right to object to the processing in certain circumstances.</p><p>We may also rely on your consent where required by law, including for certain marketing communications and non-essential cookies or similar tracking technologies. Where we rely on consent, you can withdraw it at any time. Withdrawing consent will not affect the lawfulness of any processing carried out before your withdrawal.</p><p>The legal basis used for each activity will depend on the circumstances and the requirements of applicable law. We will not use your personal information for purposes that are incompatible with the purposes for which it was collected, unless we have a lawful basis to do so.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_igJHxn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Changes to This Privacy Policy",
            "answer": "<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our business, website, services, the way we handle personal information or applicable data protection laws. Where we make changes, we will publish the updated version on our website and amend the “Last updated” date, where displayed.</p><p>We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically so that you remain informed about how LOVE MY HUMAN collects, uses, stores and protects your personal information. Where a change is significant and we are required to notify you directly by law, we will take reasonable steps to bring that change to your attention.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        },
        "question_WWBXkJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Contact Us",
            "answer": "<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, how LOVE MY HUMAN collects or uses your personal information, or how your information is protected, please contact us using the details below.</p><p><strong>Business name:</strong> The Love My Human Group Limited, trading as LOVE MY HUMAN</p><p><strong>Registered office:</strong> 308 King’s Road, London SW3 5UH, United Kingdom</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk\">hello@lovemyhuman.co.uk</a></p><p>If you wish to exercise any of your data protection rights or raise a concern about how your personal information is handled, please contact us by email. We will review your request and respond within the timeframe required by applicable data protection laws.</p><p>You also have the right to raise a concern with the UK Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) if you believe your personal information has been handled unlawfully or your data protection rights have not been respected. Further information is available at <a href=\"https://www.ico.org.uk/\">www.ico.org.uk</a>.</p>",
            "bullets": "",
            "answer_after": ""
          }
        }
